<title>HONG KONG: Chun Wo adjusts warrant subscription price.</title>
<headline>Chun Wo adjusts warrant subscription price.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chun Wo Holdings Ltd said on Wednesday it had adjusted the subscription price of its warrant to HK$1.16 per share from HK$1.28 after its shareholders approved its issue of one bonus share for every 10 shares held.</p>
<p>The construction group said the adjustment would come into effective from Wednesday.</p>
<p>The warrants will expire on March 31, 1998.</p>
<p>Chun Wo shares fell HK$0.02 to HK$1.11 at midday on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
